+### log_audit
+
+Log original queries at INFO level when query rewriting is enabled.
+Verbose mode uses DEBUG instead. This does not log bound parameter values.
+
+Default: false
+
+### rewrite_query_disconnect_on_failure
+
+Disconnect the client when a query or rewritten query exceeds the packet
+buffer if set to `true`; otherwise preserve the original query.
+Python callback errors and invalid return types always disconnect the client,
+regardless of this setting. Provided by the pgbouncer-rr extension.
+
+Default: false
+
+### rewrite_query_py_module_file
+
+Path to the Python module defining `rewrite_query(username, query,
+in_transaction)`. `not_enabled` disables query rewriting.
+
+Default: not_enabled
+
+### routing_rules_py_module_file
+
+Path to the Python module defining `routing_rules(username, query,
+in_transaction)`. `not_enabled` disables query routing.
+
+Default: not_enabled
 
 ### unix_socket_dir
 
